IMPORT `il41-nouns`

-- SECTION 16, the Law's indirect amendment of the Civil Procedure Amendment (State as Litigant) Law 5718-1958, as typed before-and-after text.  Row IL-41.
-- The instruction ADDS words at the end of s 4; it replaces nothing.  Before: read from the page image of Sefer HaChukim 251 p. 119 (1958), which no later amendment touched (the 1998 amendment,
-- Sefer HaChukim 1695 p. 34, repeals s 5 and amends s 7; the 2017 amendment, Sefer HaChukim 2635 p. 920, adds s 6A; both read from page images).  After: the instruction in s 16, read from the
-- page image of Sefer HaChukim 3550 p. 804.

§ `Section 16: the amendment`

DECLARE `An amendment that adds words at the end of a section` HAS
    `the law amended`                                                                  IS A STRING
    `the section amended`                                                              IS A STRING
    `the words of the section before the amendment`     IS A STRING
    `the instruction`                                                                  IS A STRING
    `the words the instruction adds`                                                   IS A STRING

-- lsh:147 | בחוק לתיקון סדרי הדין האזרחי (המדינה כבעל דין), התשי"ח–1958,  בסעיף 4, בסופו יבוא "בכפוף להוראות חוק היועץ המשפטי לממשלה (חוות דעת, ייצוג ופיקוח), התשפ"ו–2026".
@ref Law s 16; Civil Procedure Amendment (State as Litigant) Law 5718-1958 s 4 (Sefer HaChukim 251 p. 119); Sefer HaChukim 3550 p. 804
`the amendment s 16 makes` MEANS `An amendment that adds words at the end of a section` WITH
    `the law amended`                                                                  IS "חוק לתיקון סדרי הדין האזרחי (המדינה כבעל דין)"
    `the section amended`                                                              IS "4"
    `the words of the section before the amendment`     IS "בכל הליך שהמדינה צד לו תיוצג המדינה על ידי היועץ המשפטי לממשלה או בא־כוחו"
    `the instruction`                                                                  IS "בסופו יבוא"
    `the words the instruction adds`                                                   IS "בכפוף להוראות חוק היועץ המשפטי לממשלה (חוות דעת, ייצוג ופיקוח)"

§§ `The footnote and the number of the amendment`

DECLARE `A publication of a law` HAS
    `the Hebrew year`   IS A NUMBER
    `the page`          IS A NUMBER

-- Footnote 2 of the Law (official page 804) cites Sefer HaChukim 5718 p. 118 and 5777 p. 920.  The two amendments before s 16 were read from page images.
@ref Law s 16 footnote 2; Sefer HaChukim 251 p. 118, 1695 p. 34, 2635 p. 920
`the original publication of the State as Litigant Law` MEANS `A publication of a law` WITH `the Hebrew year` IS 5718, `the page` IS 118

@ref Sefer HaChukim 1695 p. 34
`the first amendment of the State as Litigant Law` MEANS `A publication of a law` WITH `the Hebrew year` IS 5759, `the page` IS 34

@ref Sefer HaChukim 2635 p. 920 (headed "No. 2")
`the second amendment of the State as Litigant Law` MEANS `A publication of a law` WITH `the Hebrew year` IS 5777, `the page` IS 920

GIVETH A LIST OF `A publication of a law`
`the amendments before s 16` MEANS LIST `the first amendment of the State as Litigant Law`, `the second amendment of the State as Litigant Law`

GIVETH A LIST OF `A publication of a law`
`the publications footnote 2 of the Law cites` MEANS LIST `the original publication of the State as Litigant Law`, `the second amendment of the State as Litigant Law`

-- The heading of s 16 says that this is amendment No. 3.
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number the heading of s 16 gives this amendment` MEANS 3
